# NOTE: Since you have a custom DLL, ignoring ALL .dll and .lib files by default 
# might accidentally ignore the custom ones you want to commit. 
# If your custom .dll/.lib files are stored in a specific folder (e.g., "Dependencies/" or "Libs/"), 
# you should uncomment the two lines below and add an exception for your folder:

# *.dll
# *.lib
# !Dependencies/**/*.dll
# !Dependencies/**/*.lib

